{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>牛舌最有趣的地方，是同一個部位換個做法，連咬口都變了。厚切舌根上烤網，最想吃那一圈微焦的邊。薄切牛舌落鍋涮幾下就夾起，又是另一種吃法。\n</p>\n<p>今次為大家精選10間東京Tabelog高分牛舌店，由西麻布用青蔥綁起的蔥餡牛舌，到四谷老店的水煮牛舌，還有把牛舌剁進檸檬香料咖喱的目黑小店。下次去東京，留一餐試試平時少吃的做法～</p>\n<p>🩵留言「yum」Send東京牛舌推介List &amp; 預約連結給你～</p>\n<p>為食出走 ｜ 用味蕾探索世界，由地道小食到追求極致的星級餐廳，每一啖都品嚐著每個城市最獨特的風味。哪一道美食令你念念不忘？即刻DM我哋分享你的為食出走經歷！</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Dfoeon9E-Lj/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%b1%e4%ba%ac%e7%89%9b%e8%88%8c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東京牛舌</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%b1%e4%ba%ac%e7%be%8e%e9%a3%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東京美食</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%82%ba%e9%a3%9f%e6%a6%9c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">為食榜</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：Tabelog資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Dfoeon9E-Lj/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 12 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T08:23:54.052544+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":400,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T08:00:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T09:17:28.243493+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T08:17:23.865510+00:00","content_hash":"fb6f7fe8b79c10aa87e0b69b148720b31fdc99edc9a2a7668e9f589e0c74e2fd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}